msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san... My heart is still pounding... "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Yeah... Mine too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Oooh! Can't wait to brag about this to everyone! "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Hey now..."
msgstr "Ehi, ehi..."

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Heheh! Come on, Kiryu-san, do you really think I'd do that? ...Though the "
"time you gave me is definitely worth bragging about, that's for sure. "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"...In all seriousness, though... I want to say thank you. For everything. "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Believe me, it's been a pleasure on my end, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"I don't wanna let you go just yet... But I've got a business to rebuild. "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> Hope you can understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Of course. You be careful, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"I will. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> Oh, and before I go... I "
"should let you know how much I love you, Kiryu-san! "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "You got 30,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

